  "jcr:description": "The Precision AC is Stryker's second generation autoclavable camera system. The Precision AC outputs a 1080p resolution, offering a significantly brighter image with more visible lines of resolution than the 1188 AC. In addition, the Precision AC Camera system incorporates Dynamic Range Enhancement (DRE) technology. The DRE feature adds brightness in dark and hard to see areas of the image through software built into the camera control unit. \r\n",
